<title>INDONESIA: Indah Kiat H1 net falls to 89.03 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Indah Kiat H1 net falls to 89.03 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   89.03 vs 272.17</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    43 vs 189</p>
<p>    Revenues			    820.14 vs 1,179.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  151.37 vs 510.40</p>
<p>Note: PT Indah Kiat Pulp &amp; Paper is among Indonesia's largest pulp and paper firms.</p>
</text>
